{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000827","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000827"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000827","label":"齊內史士","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"齊內史士","mention_ids":["c-shiji-009-lvhou:m005-0131"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m005-0131","chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p005","quote":"齊內史士"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m005-0131","start":131,"end":135,"surface":"齊內史士","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000827","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p005","text":"二年，楚元王、齊悼惠王皆來朝。十月，孝惠與齊王燕飲太后前，孝惠以為齊王兄，置上坐，如家人之禮。太后怒，乃令酌兩卮酖，置前，令齊王起為壽。齊王起，孝惠亦起，取卮欲俱為壽。太后乃恐，自起泛孝惠卮。齊王怪之，因不敢飲，詳醉去。問，知其酖，齊王恐，自以為不得脫長安，憂。齊內史士說王曰：「太后獨有孝惠與魯元公主。今王有七十餘城，而公主乃食數城。王誠以一郡上太后，為公主湯沐邑，太后必喜，王必無憂。」於是齊王乃上城陽之郡，尊公主為王太后。呂后喜，許之。乃置酒齊邸，樂飲，罷，歸齊王。三年，方筑長安城，四年就半，五年六年城就。諸侯來會。十月朝賀。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m005-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"楚元王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m005-0007","start":7,"end":11,"surface":"齊悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m005-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000713","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m005-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m005-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":